Package: ART
Type: Package
Title: Angular-Radial t-SNE
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Linlu Zhao
Maintainer: Linlu Zhao <zllexeter@gmail.com>
Description: Angular-Radial t-distributed Stochastic Neighbour Embedding (ART) splits each
    observation into a direction and a magnitude. Then it uses a von Mises-Fisher kernel on
    the direction and a Gaussian kernel on the magnitude, and combines the two as a product of
    experts with an adjustable weight. Comparing the ART embeddings at different weights can
    help determine whether the separation of clusters comes from direction, magnitude, or a
    mix of the two.
